{"id":95102149612343,"type":"genre","name":"Rock Progresivo","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":12,"info":{"img":null},"own_scenes":[{"id":522,"name":"Rock progresivo","book":{"id":8,"slug":"Scaruffi_Historia_del_Rock","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/","families":{"raices":{"name":"Raíces: rock'n'roll, country y roots","color":"#f59e0b"},"folk":{"name":"Folk y cantautores","color":"#a3e635"},"psico":{"name":"Psicodelia, garage y shoegaze","color":"#c084fc"},"prog":{"name":"Progresivo, krautrock y jazz-rock","color":"#38bdf8"},"hard":{"name":"Hard rock, metal y grunge","color":"#f87171"},"punk":{"name":"Punk, new wave, hardcore y noise","color":"#fb7185"},"pop":{"name":"Pop, power-pop y synth-pop","color":"#f472b6"},"dark":{"name":"Gótico e industrial","color":"#94a3b8"},"negra":{"name":"Soul, funk, disco, hip hop y baile","color":"#facc15"},"vanguardia":{"name":"Vanguardia, electrónica y ambient","color":"#2dd4bf"}}},"family":"Progresivo, krautrock y jazz-rock","color":"#38bdf8","start":1967,"end":1976,"place":"Reino Unido","desc":"Al emigrar a Gran Bretaña, el rock se convierte en mercancía de moda pero también se descontextualiza: lo que en EE UU era el diario de la juventud se vuelve en Gran Bretaña un ensayo. El progresivo no comenta la cultura juvenil sino que busca la innovación técnica: arranca con las óperas rock (S.F. Sorrow, Tommy) y los álbumes conceptuales, lo cimentan Traffic, Jeff Beck, Jethro Tull, Family y Genesis, y alcanza su cima con King Crimson (In The Court Of The Crimson King), Van Der Graaf Generator y Yes. Colosseum, la Third Ear Band (inventores de la world music), las variantes góticas (High Tide, Black Widow) y folk (Comus, Strawbs), Gentle Giant, Emerson Lake & Palmer y Roxy Music, que revoluciona el género y prepara la new wave y el synth-pop.","aka":[],"notes":[],"influences":[{"name":"Rock sinfónico","id":259826792155658,"type":"genre"},{"name":"Psicodelia británica","id":144947879225945,"type":"genre"},{"name":"Blues revival y blues-rock","id":93517293193665,"type":"genre"},{"name":"Los freaks de Los Ángeles: Zappa y Beefheart","id":31629230760470,"type":"genre"}],"refs":[],"artists":[{"id":238884878535259,"type":"artist","name":"The Who","rating":null},{"id":91958884229881,"type":"artist","name":"Genesis","rating":"3"},{"id":39107731914008,"type":"artist","name":"Roxy Music","rating":"12"},{"id":19589884367891,"type":"artist","name":"Robert Fripp","rating":"4"},{"id":115494894461320,"type":"artist","name":"King Crimson","rating":"15"},{"id":150831485949486,"type":"artist","name":"Yes","rating":"12"},{"id":159091622690060,"type":"artist","name":"Jeff Beck","rating":"2"},{"id":54924010919353,"type":"artist","name":"The Spencer Davis Group","rating":null},{"id":131770374953191,"type":"artist","name":"The Small Faces","rating":null},{"id":197897797838053,"type":"artist","name":"Emerson, Lake & Palmer","rating":"1"},{"id":47787306537014,"type":"artist","name":"Jethro Tull","rating":"2"},{"id":251929455459764,"type":"artist","name":"The Pretty Things","rating":null},{"id":19270955192767,"type":"artist","name":"The Family","rating":"14"},{"id":254015100961180,"type":"artist","name":"Traffic","rating":"2"},{"id":148042570135842,"type":"artist","name":"Jade Warrior","rating":"5"},{"id":97687586778114,"type":"artist","name":"Mark Almond","rating":null},{"id":2773823225884,"type":"artist","name":"The Zombies","rating":null},{"id":75712778317913,"type":"artist","name":"Van Der Graaf Generator","rating":"12"},{"id":209992973874044,"type":"artist","name":"Third Ear Band","rating":"102"},{"id":188695128880824,"type":"artist","name":"Curved Air","rating":"1"},{"id":252571600635124,"type":"artist","name":"Colosseum","rating":null},{"id":100051204190472,"type":"artist","name":"Blind Faith","rating":"1"},{"id":202841594870247,"type":"artist","name":"Gentle Giant","rating":null},{"id":55441254287286,"type":"artist","name":"The Amazi